      "text": "Fig. 3.1.1.6 Difference in specificity – TBSTs versus the TST",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        449.14959716796875,
        526.893310546875,
        462.29461669921875
      ],
      "text": "The overall pooled difference in specificity in 14 studies ( ) comparing TBSTs and the  Fig. 3.1.1.6",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.985991477966309,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.64959716796875,
        527.2280883789062,
        477.79461669921875
      ],
      "text": "TST was 33.5% (95% CI: 18.2–48.8%) higher for TBSTs. In studies of Diaskintest and C-TST done",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974169731140137,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.14959716796875,
        526.9667358398438,
        493.29461669921875
      ],
      "text": "in high TB incidence settings, the differences in specificity were higher for Diaskintest versus",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        495.64959716796875,
        526.9656982421875,
        508.79461669921875
      ],
      "text": "the TST (with both tests having a cut-off of at least 5 mm) (57.3%, 95% CI: 40.2–74.3%), than",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        511.14959716796875,
        526.9633178710938,
        524.2946166992188
      ],
      "text": "with Diaskintest (any induration size) versus the TST with a cut-off of at least 5 mm (29.9%,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        526.6495971679688,
        526.9635620117188,
        539.7946166992188
      ],
      "text": "95% CI: –3.66–63.5%). For C-TST versus the TST with a cut-off of at least 5 mm, the difference",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        542.1495971679688,
        526.9635009765625,
        555.2946166992188
      ],
      "text": "in specificity was 39.9% (95% CI: 34.0–45.8%). In contrast, in studies of Cy-Tb undertaken in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        557.6495971679688,
        527.0899047851562,
        570.7946166992188
      ],
      "text": "low TB incidence settings, the difference in specificity between Cy-Tb and the TST was less",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        573.1495971679688,
        527.0822143554688,
        586.2946166992188
      ],
      "text": "prominent, but was greater with the TST with a cut-off of at least 15 mm (4.61%, 95% CI:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        588.6495971679688,
        526.7271728515625,
        601.7946166992188
      ],
      "text": "–28.6–37.9%) than with the TST with a cut-off of 5 or 15 mm (–2.0%, 95% CI: –12.3–8.3%). The",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.978679656982422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        604.1495971679688,
        527.0887451171875,
        617.2946166992188
      ],
      "text": "difference may be explained by the background level of BCG in the study populations or by the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.983036994934082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.6495971679688,
        526.9666748046875,
        632.7946166992188
      ],
      "text": "cut-offs that were used.   has more details on the specificity of TBSTs versus the TST  Fig. 3.1.1.7",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.1495971679688,
        527.2897338867188,
        648.2946166992188
      ],
      "text": "in BCG-vaccinated people. Overall risk of bias was considered serious because test allocation by",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973067283630371,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        650.6495971679688,
        526.8931274414062,
        663.7946166992188
      ],
      "text": "arm was not blinded in any of the studies except those for Cy-Tb. In most Diaskintest studies,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.1495971679688,
        526.9259643554688,
        679.2946166992188
      ],
      "text": "the selection of participants and the diagnosis of the reference standard were unclear. The",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        681.6495971679688,
        526.965576171875,
        694.7946166992188
      ],
      "text": "certainty of the evidence was therefore downgraded one level for risk of bias. The difference",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        697.1495971679688,
        526.965576171875,
        710.2946166992188
      ],
      "text": "in specificity ranged from –2% to 72%; hence, the certainty of the evidence was downgraded",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.6495971679688,
        526.9666137695312,
        725.7946166992188
      ],
      "text": "one more level for inconsistency. Consequently, the certainty of the evidence for difference in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        728.1495971679688,
        300.87261962890625,
        741.2946166992188
      ],
      "text": "specificity between TBSTs and the TST was low.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        347.6684875488281,
